{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.974,"lines":[{"text":"***","t":0.2,"e":1.2},{"text":"Yeah… *ten… tenir bon…*","t":5.22,"e":6.62,"w":[["Yeah",5.22,5.42],["ten",5.52,5.72],["tenir",5.82,6.24],["bon",6.3,6.62]],"ok":0.5},{"text":"Dans le cœur y’a la lumière, même quand la nuit te suit.","t":10.24,"e":17.62,"w":[["Dans",10.24,10.38],["le",10.42,10.52],["cœur",10.62,10.86],["y’a",11,11.06],["la",11.14,11.26],["lumière",11.3,11.98],["même",15.42,15.68],["quand",15.76,15.94],["la",16,16.22],["nuit",16.28,16.54],["te",16.64,16.76],["suit",16.92,17.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"****","t":17.82,"e":18.82},{"text":"J’ai vu la pluie tomber sur mes plans, sur mes nuits,","t":22.16,"e":25.04,"w":[["J’ai",22.16,22.34],["vu",22.36,22.48],["la",22.54,22.64],["pluie",22.72,22.98],["tomber",23.06,23.32],["sur",23.4,23.52],["mes",23.56,23.68],["plans",23.76,23.96],["sur",24.12,24.34],["mes",24.42,24.58],["nuits",24.68,25.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les journées lourdes, j’les ai portées sans bruit.","t":25.58,"e":27.68,"w":[["Les",25.58,25.68],["journées",25.74,26.04],["lourdes",26.12,26.3],["j’les",26.34,26.58],["ai",26.6,26.7],["portées",26.78,27.16],["sans",27.22,27.4],["bruit",27.46,27.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand les gens parlaient, quand la porte fermait,","t":27.76,"e":30.22,"w":[["Quand",27.76,27.9],["les",27.94,28.1],["gens",28.14,28.4],["parlaient",28.48,28.98],["quand",29.1,29.24],["la",29.28,29.4],["porte",29.5,29.74],["fermait",29.8,30.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Moi je répondais par la foi, j’souriais même quand j’avais mal.","t":30.28,"e":33.4,"w":[["Moi",30.28,30.38],["je",30.44,30.56],["répondais",30.62,31.08],["par",31.14,31.26],["la",31.32,31.42],["foi",31.52,31.68],["j’souriais",31.76,32.3],["même",32.46,32.6],["quand",32.64,32.76],["j’avais",32.82,33.12],["mal",33.18,33.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mélancolie dans la gorge, mais la vérité respire,","t":33.52,"e":36.1,"w":[["Mélancolie",33.52,34.1],["dans",34.18,34.3],["la",34.34,34.44],["gorge",34.5,34.7],["mais",34.88,34.96],["la",35.02,35.12],["vérité",35.18,35.64],["respire",35.7,36.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’avance avec des cicatrices, elles écrivent mon avenir.","t":36.16,"e":38.68,"w":[["J’avance",36.16,36.52],["avec",36.62,36.82],["des",36.84,36.96],["cicatrices",37.02,37.52],["elles",37.56,37.7],["écrivent",37.76,38.02],["mon",38.06,38.26],["avenir",38.32,38.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On m’a dit “fais tes valises”, j’ai dit “non j’me relève”,","t":38.88,"e":41.5,"w":[["On",38.88,38.96],["m’a",39.04,39.16],["dit",39.2,39.3],["fais",39.34,39.5],["tes",39.54,39.66],["valises",39.72,40.06],["j’ai",40.22,40.34],["dit",40.4,40.5],["non",40.54,40.76],["j’me",40.82,41.02],["relève",41.08,41.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Parce que le rêve dans ma tête me rappelle que ça s’achève… jamais.","t":41.56,"e":45.88,"w":[["Parce",41.56,41.74],["que",41.76,41.84],["le",41.9,42],["rêve",42.06,42.2],["dans",42.24,42.36],["ma",42.4,42.5],["tête",42.56,42.72],["me",42.76,42.86],["rappelle",42.92,43.36],["que",43.42,43.52],["ça",43.62,43.72],["s’achève",43.8,44.74],["jamais",45.1,45.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"****","t":46.08,"e":47.08},{"text":"*Tiens bon… tiens bon…*","t":46.26,"e":48.62,"w":[["Tiens",46.26,46.58],["bon",47,47.24],["tiens",47.94,48.28],["bon",48.36,48.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Même si le vent te bouscule, garde la main sur ton destin.","t":49.16,"e":52.66,"w":[["Même",49.16,49.3],["si",49.36,49.48],["le",49.52,49.64],["vent",49.76,49.94],["te",50,50.12],["bouscule",50.18,50.6],["garde",50.66,50.86],["la",50.9,50.98],["main",51.1,51.28],["sur",51.38,51.52],["ton",51.6,51.76],["destin",51.8,52.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"*Tiens bon… tiens bon…*","t":54.68,"e":55.87,"w":[["Tiens",54.68,55.02],["bon",55.1,55.36],["tiens",55.51,55.71],["bon",55.67,55.87]],"ok":0.5},{"text":"J’pleure un peu, j’ris beaucoup—c’est ma route et mon chemin.","t":55.82,"e":63.1,"w":[["J’pleure",55.82,56.22],["un",56.3,56.38],["peu",56.5,56.7],["j’ris",57.02,57.28],["beaucoup",57.34,58.06],["c’est",61.32,61.54],["ma",61.62,61.82],["route",61.88,62.16],["et",62.18,62.3],["mon",62.36,62.54],["chemin",62.6,63.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"****","t":63.3,"e":64.3},{"text":"J’ai compté mes prières comme on compte les étoiles,","t":67.66,"e":70.16,"w":[["J’ai",67.66,67.82],["compté",67.88,68.14],["mes",68.18,68.32],["prières",68.38,68.84],["comme",68.9,69.06],["on",69.08,69.16],["compte",69.22,69.48],["les",69.56,69.72],["étoiles",69.8,70.16]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Chaque échec m’a formé, chaque mur m’a rendu plus solide.","t":70.2,"e":72.9,"w":[["Chaque",70.2,70.4],["échec",70.46,70.7],["m’a",70.74,70.86],["formé",70.96,71.32],["chaque",71.36,71.54],["mur",71.58,71.72],["m’a",71.76,71.86],["rendu",71.92,72.18],["plus",72.22,72.36],["solide",72.46,72.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’connais l’ombre, mais l’aube n’est pas loin,","t":73.16,"e":75.56,"w":[["J’connais",73.16,73.66],["l’ombre",73.74,74.18],["mais",74.44,74.56],["l’aube",74.64,74.86],["n’est",74.92,75.06],["pas",75.12,75.24],["loin",75.3,75.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand ta voix refuse d’abandonner, la vie change de chemin.","t":75.62,"e":78.26,"w":[["Quand",75.62,75.74],["ta",75.8,75.9],["voix",75.94,76.08],["refuse",76.14,76.42],["d’abandonner",76.46,77.08],["la",77.14,77.24],["vie",77.28,77.38],["change",77.42,77.62],["de",77.64,77.74],["chemin",77.78,78.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Y’a des soirs où j’me sens petit devant l’immensité,","t":78.38,"e":80.84,"w":[["Y’a",78.38,78.44],["des",78.48,78.58],["soirs",78.64,78.82],["où",78.84,78.88],["j’me",78.9,79.08],["sens",79.14,79.28],["petit",79.34,79.6],["devant",79.66,79.96],["l’immensité",80,80.84]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais j’sais que mon nom est plus grand que ma difficulté.","t":81.18,"e":83.58,"w":[["Mais",81.18,81.26],["j’sais",81.28,81.44],["que",81.45,81.65],["mon",81.46,81.64],["nom",81.7,81.82],["est",81.86,81.96],["plus",82.02,82.14],["grand",82.16,82.3],["que",82.34,82.46],["ma",82.52,82.64],["difficulté",82.7,83.58]],"ok":0.91},{"text":"J’travaille la nuit, j’repose la rage en douceur,","t":83.78,"e":86.28,"w":[["J’travaille",83.78,84.18],["la",84.22,84.32],["nuit",84.36,84.56],["j’repose",84.64,85.18],["la",85.22,85.34],["rage",85.42,85.64],["en",85.7,85.8],["douceur",85.86,86.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’transforme la tristesse en carburant, en moteur.","t":86.3,"e":89.24,"w":[["J’transforme",86.3,86.86],["la",86.92,87.02],["tristesse",87.06,87.58],["en",87.6,87.68],["carburant",87.74,88.38],["en",88.42,88.62],["moteur",88.46,89.24]],"ok":0.86},{"text":"****","t":89.44,"e":90.44},{"text":"*Tiens bon… tiens bon…*","t":89.46,"e":91.78,"w":[["Tiens",89.46,90.06],["bon",90.14,90.36],["tiens",91.1,91.42],["bon",91.5,91.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Même si le vent te bouscule, garde la main sur ton destin.","t":92.3,"e":95.82,"w":[["Même",92.3,92.44],["si",92.5,92.62],["le",92.66,92.84],["vent",92.9,93.08],["te",93.16,93.26],["bouscule",93.32,93.76],["garde",93.82,94],["la",94.04,94.18],["main",94.26,94.42],["sur",94.5,94.64],["ton",94.7,94.86],["destin",94.92,95.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"*Tiens bon… tiens bon…*","t":96.49,"e":98.52,"w":[["Tiens",96.49,96.69],["bon",97.15,97.35],["tiens",97.82,98.18],["bon",98.28,98.52]],"ok":0.5},{"text":"J’pleure un peu, j’ris beaucoup—c’est ma route et mon chemin.","t":98.94,"e":106.26,"w":[["J’pleure",98.94,99.36],["un",99.44,99.52],["peu",99.66,99.88],["j’ris",100.14,100.4],["beaucoup",100.46,101.2],["c’est",104.54,104.68],["ma",104.76,104.98],["route",105.04,105.32],["et",105.34,105.44],["mon",105.52,105.7],["chemin",105.76,106.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"****","t":106.46,"e":107.46},{"text":"Regarde… la mélancolie aussi peut danser,","t":110.86,"e":113.98,"w":[["Regarde",110.86,111.42],["la",111.7,111.8],["mélancolie",111.86,112.52],["aussi",112.58,112.96],["peut",113.08,113.34],["danser",113.42,113.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand tu l’écoutes, elle te montre où chercher.","t":114.38,"e":116.64,"w":[["Quand",114.38,114.52],["tu",114.56,114.68],["l’écoutes",114.7,115.08],["elle",115.1,115.22],["te",115.26,115.38],["montre",115.48,115.8],["où",115.82,115.98],["chercher",116.04,116.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et la joie n’arrive pas par hasard—","t":116.77,"e":118.84,"w":[["Et",116.77,116.97],["la",116.9,117.04],["joie",117.1,117.36],["n’arrive",117.42,117.78],["pas",117.84,118.02],["par",118.08,118.26],["hasard",118.3,118.84]],"ok":0.86},{"text":"C’est le fruit d’une lutte qui s’apprend sans regard.","t":118.92,"e":121.44,"w":[["C’est",118.92,119.04],["le",119.1,119.24],["fruit",119.34,119.52],["d’une",119.56,119.74],["lutte",119.8,120],["qui",120.04,120.16],["s’apprend",120.24,120.66],["sans",120.74,120.9],["regard",120.96,121.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"****","t":121.64,"e":122.64},{"text":"Aujourd’hui j’porte mon rêve comme un drapeau au vent,","t":121.69,"e":124.1,"w":[["Aujourd’hui",121.5,121.92],["j’porte",121.94,122.28],["mon",122.32,122.48],["rêve",122.54,122.76],["comme",122.82,122.98],["un",123.02,123.08],["drapeau",123.14,123.48],["au",123.54,123.76],["vent",123.84,124.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pas pour briller pour les autres—pour tenir jusqu’à demain.","t":124.16,"e":126.78,"w":[["Pas",124.16,124.3],["pour",124.34,124.46],["briller",124.5,124.8],["pour",124.86,124.98],["les",125.04,125.22],["autres",125.26,125.44],["pour",125.5,125.62],["tenir",125.68,125.96],["jusqu’à",126.02,126.3],["demain",126.36,126.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Si la douleur revient, j’la respecte, j’la fais taire,","t":127.04,"e":129.46,"w":[["Si",127.04,127.14],["la",127.2,127.32],["douleur",127.38,127.7],["revient",127.72,128.08],["j’la",128.12,128.3],["respecte",128.36,128.76],["j’la",128.78,128.98],["fais",129.04,129.18],["taire",129.26,129.46]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Car mon cœur a compris : la vie a besoin de lumière.","t":129.54,"e":132.24,"w":[["Car",129.54,129.68],["mon",129.72,129.86],["cœur",129.94,130.18],["a",130.22,130.32],["compris",130.38,130.7],["la",130.76,130.84],["vie",130.92,131.06],["a",131.12,131.18],["besoin",131.24,131.52],["de",131.58,131.68],["lumière",131.74,132.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Alors j’règle ma voix, j’fais chanter la tempête,","t":132.32,"e":134.88,"w":[["Alors",132.32,132.52],["j’règle",132.56,133.02],["ma",133.08,133.2],["voix",133.28,133.44],["j’fais",133.5,133.7],["chanter",133.74,134.04],["la",134.1,134.22],["tempête",134.28,134.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je demande au ciel un signe, et je deviens ce signe.","t":134.94,"e":137.58,"w":[["Je",134.94,135.04],["demande",135.12,135.44],["au",135.46,135.54],["ciel",135.58,135.78],["un",135.82,135.92],["signe",136.06,136.3],["et",136.34,136.4],["je",136.46,136.56],["deviens",136.62,136.92],["ce",136.98,137.22],["signe",137.34,137.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand on m’a mis des chaînes, j’ai trouvé la clé dans mes mains :","t":137.64,"e":140.26,"w":[["Quand",137.64,137.8],["on",137.84,137.92],["m’a",137.98,138.1],["mis",138.14,138.26],["des",138.3,138.42],["chaînes",138.46,138.76],["j’ai",138.8,138.92],["trouvé",138.96,139.26],["la",139.32,139.42],["clé",139.46,139.6],["dans",139.64,139.76],["mes",139.82,139.94],["mains",140.04,140.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La persévérance… c’est la seule loi qui gagne au final.","t":140.32,"e":143.68,"w":[["La",140.32,140.44],["persévérance",140.5,141.24],["c’est",141.52,141.64],["la",141.7,141.78],["seule",141.84,142],["loi",142.02,142.28],["qui",142.34,142.46],["gagne",142.56,142.86],["au",142.9,143],["final",143.08,143.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"****","t":143.88,"e":144.88},{"text":"*Tiens bon… tiens bon…*","t":145.02,"e":145.88,"w":[["Tiens",145.02,145.36],["bon",145.44,145.56],["tiens",145.6,145.86],["bon",145.86,145.88]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Même si le monde te freine, continue à croire en toi.","t":145.96,"e":149.4,"w":[["Même",145.96,146.36],["si",146.46,146.58],["le",146.64,146.78],["monde",146.86,147.12],["te",147.18,147.3],["freine",147.42,147.68],["continue",147.76,148.3],["à",148.38,148.48],["croire",148.54,148.82],["en",148.88,149.06],["toi",149.1,149.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"*Tiens bon… tiens bon…*","t":150.08,"e":152.44,"w":[["Tiens",150.08,150.76],["bon",150.84,151.1],["tiens",151.78,152.1],["bon",152.18,152.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J’porte la mélancolie, mais j’la transforme en joie.","t":152.52,"e":160.2,"w":[["J’porte",152.52,153.26],["la",153.34,153.5],["mélancolie",153.58,154.8],["mais",158.34,158.5],["j’la",158.52,158.78],["transforme",158.82,159.66],["en",159.7,159.82],["joie",159.9,160.2]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"****","t":160.4,"e":161.4},{"text":"Yeah… *ten… tenir bon…*","t":162.58,"e":165.78,"w":[["Yeah",162.58,163.34],["ten",163.81,164.01],["tenir",164.28,165.36],["bon",165.44,165.78]],"ok":0.75},{"text":"Le rêve est vivant… tant que ton cœur le chante.","t":168.86,"e":174.22,"w":[["Le",168.86,168.96],["rêve",169.04,169.3],["est",169.36,169.46],["vivant",169.52,170.16],["tant",171.86,172.12],["que",172.18,172.32],["ton",172.4,172.6],["cœur",172.72,173],["le",173.06,173.16],["chante",173.3,174.22]],"ok":1.0}]}